    "expectedRule": "Causal Clearinghouse tracks a causal ledger with debt 0-4. Clearing a monster or trap node (except the zero_sum_auditor boss) opens a pending ledger for that node; while pending, departure is blocked and the player must choose balance (no effect), overdraw (debt +1, heal 10% maxHp, +108 run reward points) or repay (debt -1, damage 15% maxHp, 8% with return_anchor_belt). The law display '因果账本' shows 因果债 N/4 with 账目已结/待平账/追缴印 N states. Route gates causal_cause_bailiff_lane, causal_effect_bailiff_lane and causal_verdict_bridge open with debt at most 2; causal_north_verdict_lock at most 1; causal_east_verdict_lock at most 3; closed gates expose their real block reason '因果债需降至 N 或以下；在待平账中选择偿还以降债。' and remove the edge from legal adjacent targets, so run/move through a closed gate is rejected illegal-move. Starting the zero_sum_auditor boss combat locks the debt and mints collection seals equal to outstanding debt (minus echo_breaker_gauntlets); each damaging attack against the boss consumes one seal, halving final damage, with log '追缴印抵消本次攻势，最终伤害减半，剩余 N 枚。'; after the lock the ledger can no longer be rewritten. Ledger state persists through a save-codec round-trip. Re-selecting a cleared node is rejected already-resolved without changing law state or HP; resolving a ledger choice with no pending is rejected domain-rejected. All expected values are frozen here, never read from candidate code."
  },
